caption:
Ten thousands of people. Zero chaos.
Long wait,Completely worth it.

When the lanterns lit up Borobudur, I felt something I can’t quite put into words — just a quiet heart and a simple wish: peace for everyone, everywhere.

First Vesak in 14 years.
Won‘t be my last.
